Subject: [PATCH 112/244] Improve canvas page functionality and resilience

Enhance HTML entity unescaping, implement auto-discovery for canvas pages, and update manifest handling to prevent data loss.

Replit-Commit-Author: Agent
Replit-Commit-Session-Id: 9b6db5b8-bb27-4a35-8d77-7730eb3a7059
Replit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint
